    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stack the Love of Captain Marine!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hololive members transform into adorable treasures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack the 3D Hololive characters without letting them overflow to create your very own mountain in this must-play 3D puzzle game for Hololive fans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just toss the treasures and stack them on the island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine identical treasures to transform them into larger ones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game ends when a treasure falls off the island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create bigger treasures and make consecutive combinations to boost your score through chain reactions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when you create the largest treasure, something amazing happens\u2026!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Treasure Exchange</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The treasures that appear in the game can be swapped with other members!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize to your liking and create your own unique mountain of favorite characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rankings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with players from around the world and test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for the high score and keep challenging yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a participant in the indie game brand &quot;&quot;holo Indie&quot;&quot; (\u203b2), developed by CCMC Inc. (\u203b1.).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has been approved for distribution and monetization under the guidelines and regulations of &quot;&quot;holo Indie&quot;&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that the monetization of derivative games using content owned by Cover Corporation outside of &quot;&quot;holo Indie&quot;&quot; is not permitted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b1. About CCMC Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CCMC Corp. is entrusted with website management (ex: steam) including, examination, publishing and other necessary tasks by Cover Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b2. About &quot;&quot;holo Indie&quot;&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >holo Indie's objective is to cooperate with hololive production fans and creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a game brand that offers &quot;&quot;Game Creator Support Program&quot;&quot; for the derivative work games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more details about &quot;&quot;holo Indie&quot;&quot;, Please refer to the Cover Corp.'s &quot;&quot;Derivative work guidelines&quot;&quot;.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stack the Love of Captain Marine!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hololive members transform into adorable treasures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack the 3D Hololive characters without letting them overflow to create your very own mountain in this must-play 3D puzzle game for Hololive fans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just toss the treasures and stack them on the island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine identical treasures to transform them into larger ones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game ends when a treasure falls off the island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create bigger treasures and make consecutive combinations to boost your score through chain reactions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when you create the largest treasure, something amazing happens\u2026!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Treasure Exchange</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The treasures that appear in the game can be swapped with other members!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize to your liking and create your own unique mountain of favorite characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rankings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with players from around the world and test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for the high score and keep challenging yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a participant in the indie game brand &quot;&quot;holo Indie&quot;&quot; (\u203b2), developed by CCMC Inc. (\u203b1.).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has been approved for distribution and monetization under the guidelines and regulations of &quot;&quot;holo Indie&quot;&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that the monetization of derivative games using content owned by Cover Corporation outside of &quot;&quot;holo Indie&quot;&quot; is not permitted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b1. About CCMC Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CCMC Corp. is entrusted with website management (ex: steam) including, examination, publishing and other necessary tasks by Cover Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b2. About &quot;&quot;holo Indie&quot;&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >holo Indie's objective is to cooperate with hololive production fans and creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a game brand that offers &quot;&quot;Game Creator Support Program&quot;&quot; for the derivative work games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more details about &quot;&quot;holo Indie&quot;&quot;, Please refer to the Cover Corp.'s &quot;&quot;Derivative work guidelines&quot;&quot;.</p>",
